<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>helloWorld</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <main class="landing">
        <section class="hero">
            <p class="tiny">hello, internet</p>
            <h1>there's room for you here.</h1>
            <p>a little social space for sharing things, meeting people, and being yourself.</p>
            <div class="buttons">
                <a href="/register" class="button">join us</a>
                <a href="/login" class="button secondary">log in</a>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="welcome">
            <h2>everyone starts somewhere.</h2>
            <p>you don't need to know anyone. you don't need to be popular. just come as you are.</p>
            <p>make a profile, say hello, share something you like, and find your people.</p>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>